<h2>Where the cost sits</h2>
<p>The cell is the largest cost, but the BMS, thermal hardware and enclosure decide whether the pack survives. A cheaper cell with an undersized BMS is not a cheaper pack; it is a shorter-lived one. Compare the bill of materials, not only the cell price.</p>
